stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: row inserted together with the state change
    Pending --> Processed: PublishAsync succeeded, MarkAsProcessed
    Pending --> Backoff: handler threw, FailedAttempt (wait 20 / 40 / 80 / 160 s)
    Backoff --> Pending: NextAttemptOn reached
    Pending --> Dead: fifth failure, AttemptCount becomes 6, MarkMessageAsDead
    Processed --> [*]
    Dead --> [*]: excluded from the poll, no automatic replay
    note right of Pending
        ProcessedOn null, IsDead false
        AttemptCount starts at 1
    end note
    note right of Dead
        IsDead true
        Errors keeps every message
    end note
